{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q309033","formula":"C₂HgN₂O₂","hill":"C2HgN2O2","elements":["C","N","O","Hg"],"composition":{"C":2.0,"N":2.0,"O":2.0,"Hg":1.0},"names":{"en":"Mercury fulminate","ru":"Фульминат ртути(II)","uk":"Гримуча ртуть"},"descriptions":{"en":"Mercury(II) fulminate is an explosive with the chemical formula Hg(CNO)2. When recrystallized from water it exists as the hemihydrate 2 Hg(CNO)2·H2O. The anhydrous form is obtained by recrystallization from ethanol. It is highly sensitive to friction, heat and shock and is mainly used as a trigger for other explosives in percussion caps and detonators.","ru":"Фульмина́т рту́ти (грему́чая ртуть) — ртутная соль фульминовой (гремучей) кислоты, инициирующее взрывчатое вещество.","uk":"Гриму́ча ртуть, або фульміна́т рту́ті (англ. mercury fulminate; нім. Quecksilberfulminat n), — сполука ряду фульмінатів складу Hg(ONC)2, ртутна сіль гримучої (фульмінатної) кислоти."},"fame":44,"pubchemCid":12359,"mass":284.63,"charge":0,"smiles":"[C-]#[N+][O-].[C-]#[N+][O-].[Hg+2]","inchikey":"AUXQRZIGZMRZBW-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"mercury(2+);oxidoazaniumylidynemethane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-1104028","atoms":50,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[5.988,0.0,0.0],[0.0,10.406,0.0],[0.0,0.0,8.347]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":2.994,"y":0.0,"z":4.173,"el":"Hg"},{"x":2.994,"y":10.406,"z":4.173,"el":"Hg"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Hg"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":8.347,"el":"Hg"},{"x":0.0,"y":10.406,"z":0.0,"el":"Hg"},{"x":0.0,"y":10.406,"z":8.347,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.988,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.988,"y":0.0,"z":8.347,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.988,"y":10.406,"z":0.0,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.988,"y":10.406,"z":8.347,"el":"Hg"},{"x":2.994,"y":1.887,"z":4.897,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":3.316,"z":3.449,"el":"C"},{"x":5.988,"y":3.316,"z":3.449